 ('retention','5. Retention and security','<p>We retain correspondence as reasonably necessary to handle the enquiry, resolve disputes, prevent abuse and meet applicable obligations. Provider logs follow the provider’s own retention practices. No transmission or storage system is completely secure; avoid sending sensitive files by email.</p>'),
