 ('payments','4. Advertising and subscriptions','<p>The free app displays advertisements. A paid subscription provides an ad-free experience. The price, billing period, renewal and any trial terms shown in Google Play at purchase govern your subscription. Do not assume that uninstalling the app cancels a subscription.</p><p>Manage or cancel purchases through your Google Play account. Refund requests follow applicable store rules and consumer law. See <a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/7018481">Google Play’s subscription guidance</a>. FT PVT. LIMITED does not directly collect your full payment-card number.</p>'),
